package com.keybase.app.ui

/**
 * The app name and "by shaamil" as FIGlet lettering (font "Slant" by Glenn Chappell), pre-rendered so the app
 * needs no font file. [AsciiGlyphs] says how to draw each character as lines, so the lettering is drawn on a
 * fixed grid and looks the same on every phone. Generated by a one-off script.
 */
